[REF] base/website: introduce website model in base and put it on `env`

Move a minimal skeleton of the `website` model into the `base` module,
including core fields: `domain`, `domain_punycode`, `company_id`, and
`user_id` (public user).

This architectural change provides a low-level reference for request
processing, enabling the system to determine a context `host_id` without
introducing circular dependencies or relying on higher-level website
modules.  It lays the groundwork for a more robust, environment-agnostic
request handling system.

The current website is made available on the environment object.

